@prefix pr: <https://ggen.dev/ontology/protocol-integration#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

pr:Protocol a rdfs:Class .
pr:Transport a rdfs:Class .
pr:Message a rdfs:Class .
